  "body": "**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Add Codex to cx53's service PATH**\n\nOn the documented cx53 systemd deployment, routing Ariadne here makes every wake use `CodexProvider.spawn`, which launches the bare `codex` command, but `deploy/systemd/hive-edge.service` fixes `PATH` to system directories while the cx53 binary is installed under `/home/hive/.local/bin`. Unless the private `edge.env` happens to contain an undocumented PATH override, each wake will fail with `ENOENT` and eventually exhaust its retries; add that directory to the cx53 service environment or install/link the binary into the service PATH before moving the subscription.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.",
